#: InstalledFontListWidget.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Installing and uninstalling the fonts only copies them to / removes them from "
"the X fonts folder. In order to make X, Ghostscript, and StarOffice aware of "
"the changes you must \"configure\" your system - this will create the "
"necessary configuration files needed by the various programs."
msgstr ""
"Instalar e desinstala-las fontes só as copia ou as borra do cartafol de "
"fontes das X. Para facer que as X, Ghostscript e StarOffice as detecten "
"débese configura-lo sistema - isto creará os ficheiros de configuración "
"precisos por varios programas."

